		["18 areas to discover here, levels 4-12."] = "18 zones à découvrir ici, niveaux 4-12.",
		["Alliance guards: touch the edge of {area:108} and move on"] = "Gardes de l'Alliance : touchez le bord de {area:108} et repartez",
